s="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Show cause received</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Detailed response</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Delhi HC precedents</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><line x1="30" y1="28" x2="90" y2="28" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="30" y1="40" x2="85" y2="40" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3"/><rect x="65" y="55" width="35" height="18" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><text x="82" y="67" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">148A</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Defence Filed</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">S.148A(d) Order and S.148 Notice</h3><p class="step-description">AO passes speaking order under S.148A(d). If approved by specified authority, issues S.148 notice. The 148A(d) order is key - if it doesn't address your objections, the entire reassessment can be quashed.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Order reviewed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></