                <p><strong>Section 147/148 ka notice aaya hai, kya karein?</strong> Sabse pehle 148A response mein strong objection do. Return bhi file karo deadline mein. Patron Delhi office se CA madad lo - Delhi HC precedents ke saath defence milega.</p>
<p><strong>Kitne saal purana return reopen ho sakta hai?</strong> Normal 3 saal. Rs 50 lakh se zyada escaped income par 10 saal tak.</p>
<p><strong>Kya previously assessed return reopen ho sakta hai?</strong> Haan, par sirf nayi information ke basis par. Change of opinion valid nahi.</p>

